  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/banner-text.webp\" alt=\"logo\"></p>\n<h2><strong>Minecraft: Java Edition 模组/数据包</strong></h2>\n<h1>你看不见他，但我保证他能看见你……</h1>\n<p>进入恐惧与神秘的世界吧。《From The Fog》是一款 Minecraft 模组，以符合传说的方式，将传奇人物 Herobrine 栩栩如生地带入游戏，带来惊悚且沉浸式的体验。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunareclipse.studio%252fdownload%252fFrom-The-Fog%252fwallpaper%252f3rd-Birthday\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/wallpaper-promo.webp\" style=\"margin-left:auto !important;margin-right:auto !important\">\n</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flilypad.gg%252flunareclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/partners/lilypad_transparent.webp?v=6\" style=\"margin-left:auto !important;margin-right:auto !important\">\n</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/banner.webp\" alt=\"banner\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/forest-encounter.webp\" alt=\"forest-encounter\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/window-watcher.webp\" alt=\"window-watcher\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/new-grove.webp\" alt=\"new-grove\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/shrine-suprise.webp\" alt=\"shrine-surprise\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/unknown-entity-err.webp\" alt=\"unkown-entity-err\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/more-skins!.webp\" alt=\"more-skins!\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/ocean-sand-pyramid.webp\" alt=\"ocean-sand-pyramid\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/2x2-tunnel.webp\" alt=\"2x2-tunnel\"></p>\n<h2><strong>安装指南</strong></h2>\n<h4>稳定版发布</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog\" alt=\"GitHub release\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunareclipse.studio%252fko-fi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donate to-kofi-7e18c7?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p>\n<p>From The Fog 的最新版本发布在我们的 <a href=\"https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 发布页面</a>上。\n这些版本被认为<strong>适合一般使用</strong>，但不能保证完全无 Bug 或其他问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>社区</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RmMtqxJJgH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/chat on-discord-7289DA?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord chat\"></a></p>\n<p>我们拥有 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lunareclipse.studio%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Discord 社区。</a> 加入后你可以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>获取安装帮助和技术支持</li>\n<li>第一时间了解最新开发动态</li>\n<li>与其他社区成员一起交流互动。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>许可证</strong></h2>\n<p>本项目采用知识共享署名-非商业性使用-相同方式共享 4.0 国际许可协议（CC BY-NC-SA 4.0）进行授权。只要注明原作者、不用于商业用途，并且以相同许可证分享任何修改内容，你就可以自由使用和修改该模组/数据包。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog/blob/main/LICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 文件。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>网站</strong></h2>\n<p>欢迎访问我们的网站！\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunareclipse.studio%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://lunareclipse.studio</a></p>",
